    <div class="ws-content">
      <div class="ws-current"><div class="ws-panel-heading"><strong>Current Contract</strong><span>UW-DEMO-{{ current.id }}</span></div>
        <div v-if="current.tab === 'basic'" class="ws-fields"><h4 class="ws-section-title">종목정보</h4><label>종목<input value="일반배상책임보험" readonly /></label><label>세부종목<input value="영업배상책임" readonly /></label><label>상품코드<input value="GL · 일반배상" readonly /></label><label>국내해외 구분<input value="국내" readonly /></label><h4 class="ws-section-title">계약정보</h4><label>계약자<input :value="current.company" readonly /></label><label>보험기간<input value="2026.01.01 – 2026.12.31" readonly /></label><label>담보지역<input value="대한민국" readonly /></label><label class="ws-full">검토 메모<textarea v-model="current.memo" aria-label="현재 계약 검토 메모" rows="3"></textarea></label></div>
        <div v-else-if="current.tab === 'detail'" class="ws-detail"><div class="ws-hierarchy"><span>Total</span><span>› 목적물 01 · 예시 사업장</span><strong>› 담보 / 위험</strong></div><h4 class="ws-section-title">담보 선택</h4><div class="ws-subtabs"><button v-for="coverage in ['시설 배상', '생산물 배상']" :key="coverage" type="button" :aria-pressed="current.coverage === coverage" @click="current.coverage = coverage">{{ coverage }}</button></div><h4 class="ws-section-title">담보 조건 · {{ current.coverage }}</h4><dl><div><dt>목적물</dt><dd>예시 사업장</dd></div><div><dt>선택 담보</dt><dd>{{ current.coverage }}</dd></div><div><dt>위험 기준</dt><dd>{{ current.coverage === '시설 배상' ? '사업장 면적' : '연간 매출액' }}</dd></div><div><dt>보상한도</dt><dd>KRW 1,000,000,000</dd></div><div><dt>자기부담금</dt><dd>KRW 5,000,000</dd></div></dl><div class="ws-risk-note"><b>위험평가 연결</b><span>담보를 전환하면 위험 기준과 Reference의 비교 대상이 함께 바뀝니다.</span></div></div>
        <div v-else-if="current.tab === 'terms'" class="ws-terms"><h4 class="ws-section-title">국내 약관 · 계약 적용 조건</h4><div class="ws-clause-input"><label>추가할 약관<select v-model="clause"><option>교차배상책임 특별약관</option><option>하청업자 배상책임 특별약관</option></select></label><button type="button" @click="addClause">추가</button></div><div class="ws-list-heading"><span>선택 약관 {{ current.clauses.length }}건</span><span>적용 여부</span></div><ul><li v-for="item in current.clauses" :key="item"><span><i class="ws-check">✓</i>{{ item }}</span><button type="button" :aria-label="`${item} 삭제`" @click="current.clauses = current.clauses.filter(c => c !== item)">삭제</button></li></ul><p class="ws-side-note">추가한 약관과 삭제한 상태는 계약별로 유지됩니다.</p></div>
